          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಹೋದ್ಯೋಗಿ (sahōdyōgi) is Sanskrit saha, \"with\", and udyogin, \"one who works\", from udyoga, \"exertion, work\" (CDIAL 2055): \"one who works with\"."
